menu "Ringkit"

    config RINGKIT_NET
        bool "Enable ring_net (WebRTC voice)"
        default y
        help
            Compile the ring_net module: Qianwen WebRTC push-to-talk
            (SDP signaling, Opus codec, DataChannel protocol). Disabling
            drops esp_peer and the WebRTC code from the image; applications
            that call ring_net_* will fail to link.

    config RINGKIT_WS
        bool "Enable ring_ws (WebSocket voice)"
        default y
        help
            Compile the ring_ws module: Qianwen WebSocket voice chat
            (session/turn JSON, PCM transport). Disabling drops
            esp_websocket_client from the image; applications that call
            ring_ws_* will fail to link.

    config RINGKIT_CHAT
        bool "Enable ring_chat (STT/LLM/TTS cascade)"
        default y
        help
            Compile the ring_chat module: the STT -> LLM -> TTS cascade
            used by the push-to-talk apps. Disabling drops ring_stt,
            ring_llm and ring_tts; applications that call ring_chat_* will
            fail to link.

    config RINGKIT_BT
        bool "Enable ring_bt (BLE peripheral)"
        default y
        help
            Compile the ring_bt module: Bluetooth LE peripheral (GAP,
            GATT). Disabling drops bt from the image; applications that
            call ring_bt_* will fail to link.

endmenu
